# Metric — Layout A: compact KPI tile

Small square tile (2x2). Big number is the whole point; agg + filter
summary as fine print. Stacks 4-6 across in a strip.

```
+----------------------+
| Open deals       (i) |
|                      |
|        128           |
|                      |
| count . stage = open |
+----------------------+
```

Config: agg=count|sum|avg, field (for sum/avg), conditions footer
auto-derived. Optional delta vs prior period later.
